@star y-dwarf
name: Y-type brown dwarf
makeup: hydrogen 91%, helium 8.8%, oxygen 0.045%, carbon 0.025%, neon 0.008%, nitrogen 0.006%, magnesium 0.004%, silicon 0.003%, iron 0.003%
makeup-note: cool enough for ammonia clouds, near room temperature
surface-kind: brown-dwarf
real: yes
says: the coldest brown dwarfs, barely warmer than a planet
