@star rr-lyrae
name: RR Lyrae variable
makeup: hydrogen 91.5%, helium 8.4%, oxygen 0.02%, carbon 0.008%, neon 0.003%, nitrogen 0.002%, magnesium 0.0015%, silicon 0.001%, iron 0.0005%, sulfur 0.0005%
makeup-note: an old star, poor in the heavier elements (about a tenth of a young star's share)
surface-kind: normal
real: yes
says: an old pulsing star that brightens and dims in less than a day
radius-sol: 4..6
temp-k: 6100..7400
share-of-stars: rare

@star mira
name: Mira variable
makeup: hydrogen 90.5%, helium 9.4%, oxygen 0.045%, nitrogen 0.02%, carbon 0.012%, neon 0.008%, magnesium 0.004%, silicon 0.003%, iron 0.003%, titanium 0.0001%
surface-kind: giant
real: yes
says: a pulsing red giant that brightens and dims over months
